sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as You
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant API as API
  participant A as Assist runner (Playwright, headed)
  participant ATS as Employer ATS page
  U->>UI: Click "Assist apply"
  UI->>API: POST /applications/:id/assist
  API->>API: allow-list check (never LinkedIn / Indeed / Naukri)
  API->>A: start with approved resume + facts
  A->>ATS: open apply URL in visible browser
  A->>ATS: fill name, email, phone, upload PDF
  A-->>U: "Review everything, press Submit yourself"
  U->>ATS: solves CAPTCHA, answers questions, clicks Submit
  U->>UI: Click "Mark as submitted"
  UI->>API: PATCH /applications/:id status=SUBMITTED
  API->>API: write ApplicationEvent + AuditLog
